Try this first (i'm not getting the same error)
z=rhlapply(10,runif,mapred=list(mapred.job.tracker='local'))
rhex(z)

This should return a list of length 10, each of two elements. The
element whose key==i has a vector i unifs.
It should run as a local job.

For the example below, paste mapred in the email
Regards
Saptarshi

